# The example app uses continuous native generation: `npx expo prebuild`
# regenerates ios/ and android/ from app.json and the config plugin, so the
# generated projects are build output, not source. The plugin's effect on them is
# covered by tests in each package's plugin/src/__tests__.
apps/*/ios/
apps/*/android/
